# The sandbox image pins: the same files in omnirush-cli (src/box/) and omnirush-gui (apps/server/src/box/).
# retention.mjs (+ .d.mts): which sandbox images stay across box-version updates (current + previous pins, images in use).
# host-builds.json: the rules and notices for folders with macOS/Windows builds (host-builds.js / host-builds.ts read it).
# required.json: the mandatory sandbox (setup per OS, build-artefact shadows, host-only projects, texts); required.js / required.ts read it.
# A change to one must be ported to the other and this list updated in both (scripts/box/pins.mjs refreshes the pins' list).
